    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/2-the-old-rectory-lucan-dublin-k78-n9p8\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 2 The Old Rectory, Lucan.\r\n\r\nNestled in the exclusive gated community of The Old Rectory, this is a charming terraced dwelling ideal for convenience and tranquillity. This attractive two-bedroom, two-bathroom terraced house is superbly located at the edge of Lucan village, offering easy access to an array of shops, cafés, and restaurants. Local educational institutions such as Lucan BNS and St. Joseph’s College are within reach, making it a prime location for families.\r\n\r\nThe exterior of the property is distinguished by its traditional architectural style, set within a well-maintained development with lush green communal spaces. The facade is elegant, accentuated by classic brickwork and large windows, which add to its period charm.\r\n\r\nUpon entering this inviting home, you are greeted by a spacious hallway leading into the light-filled living room, which boasts a cosy atmosphere perfect for relaxation or entertaining. Large windows enhance the living room's brightness, offering views of the communal gardens. The kitchen is equipped with contemporary fittings and provides ample storage space, offering a practical and functional layout.\r\n\r\nEach of the two sizeable bedrooms provides a tranquil retreat with large windows that illuminate the rooms. The master bedroom also features built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nThe two bathrooms are well-appointed for modern living, with quality fixtures and fittings.\r\n\r\nSituated close to major transport routes, residents can easily connect to Dublin's city centre. This property is eligible for a vacant grant, adding an attractive financial incentive.\r\n\r\nThis home is ideal for first-time buyers or those looking to downsize, providing a harmonious balance between village life and urban convenience. With its prime location and practical layout, it offers a compelling opportunity for investors as well."
      },
